    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning Newly Renovated Mid-Terrace Home – First Time Let now availableOMD Estates Agents are delighted to bring to the rental market this two bedroom beautifully renovated mid-terrace home, originally built circa 1900 and thoughtfully upgraded to offer a superb combination of period charm and modern living.\r\nThe property has been finished to a very high standard throughout, featuring high-quality furnishings, a newly installed combi boiler, and a stunning contemporary kitchen with brand new appliances throughout and excellent finishes.\r\nOne of the standout features is the beautiful skylight roof, which floods the kitchen with an abundance of natural light and creates a bright and welcoming space.\r\nThe property also benefits from a stylish en-suite shower room, complete with a heated mirror and additional skylight, providing a bright, modern and luxurious feel.\r\nOutside, the property boasts a lovely spacious private garden, offering an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing and enjoying some fresh air.\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to rent a beautifully renovated home finished to a high standard, and early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Two-bedroom mid-terrace home\r\nFirst-time let following a complete renovation\r\nOriginally built circa 1900, retaining period charm\r\nBeautifully renovated throughout to a high standard\r\nHigh-quality furnishings\r\nNewly installed combi boiler\r\nStunning contemporary kitchen\r\nBrand-new kitchen appliances\r\nExcellent modern finishes throughout\r\nLarge skylight in the kitchen providing excellent natural light\r\nStylish en-suite shower room\r\nHeated bathroom mirror\r\nAdditional skylight in the en-suite\r\nSpacious private rear garden\r\nIdeal for outdoor dining, entertaining and relaxing\r\nBright, modern and welcoming accommodation\r\nEarly viewing highly recommended"
      },
